<span id="A1.T7.11.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Analysis: The response correctly extracts information from the provided documents, identifying that Drachen Fire was located behind the Big Bad Wolf and Das Festhaus at Busch Gardens Williamsburg. The search query used is appropriate for finding information about the Drachen Fire roller coaster. The response correctly decides to conduct a search to find the specific information needed to answer the question.</span>
<span id="A1.T7.11.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Scores: <span id="A1.T7.11.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;final_score&gt;</span> 3,3 <span id="A1.T7.11.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/final_score&gt;</span></span>
